notes.body:
Is this something that could be done by parsing the ISO 6093 format directly and then:

- for FN1, just converting the integer to a floating-point value;
- for FN2, combining the integer and the exponent inferred from the decimal-mark position into a floating-point value;
- for FN3, combining the integer part, and the combination of the exponent inferred from the decimal-mark position an the exponent specified in the string, into a floating-point value?

